t: Alignment.center,\n      child: FittedBox(\n        fit: BoxFit.contain,\n        child: isLight\n            ? ColorFiltered(colorFilter: _invertFilter, child: skin)\n            : skin,\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1787728745678}}},{"sequence":1529,"timestamp":"2026-08-26T07:19:13.276199Z","elapsed_seconds":94.504,"source":"pi","event":{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Investigating media controls**\n\nI want to clarify whether the skin_layout usage is exclusive or if it extends to other components like heroes or polo_hero. It seems like a good idea to inspect these elements closely to check for media controls. I'm curious about how they might function or be integrated elsewhere, so verifying this might help me gather more information. Let's figure out how this all connects!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_05eb361b1ac9549b016a8e9367b4f481959e4f8d5868f1d5e9\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqjpNpwVb3mIOaMxL8C9LipcKJEHxsJFCTF96FA8BewhjtGSHpzu5SjRU-gth9cGsWB0y7xUgK6XxluX68MpBpEELIqsRLCxteSi2dPfuq6YpOGeXq3vhZkirNGF-uD_8GwWobh1-sgefIy7rChKpwz84BOGX2gUoQYngW79vZCZbtxXiG3WzLFQbOXCJ9wxYhM7u5LFPEnJG_mUREiFlQGVTEOInv2hziLRGI3_ZwzmowOJneZMgnYv7mDpRfRHLaBAnyQAO8PbGCZtpX5P6Lix5mEVqhYDfCNE3YWNW1r62DHYUw2AUw_ZXjFFk2JP7RXydVRuGqOJlUCjvauOIosC4vdVhVrwalsabldDJ93X1AyFX-DXVfTjyfhc-vbNlcBkwJTtJdkbQSOM30w8KkwiiJ9dneN2eeZHcDAE1txdRsrRgzCdL1iTmpiAThXUJXwjOO2_DsMsJY9pOD-ooiZctr3QzP9rOqwDr_9VrqEOXUKiWwJ6rSVMUgxPja7ZriOhOfsWCC2pzv46134H-xpRhbjvMm7WEwUINd_4R-hzj7ZrAVJSGJotMOWbNoKb9Q8IF02NyI2KYP194iL4pGfDIiFyDaKuKX8TJIi_aaG8Cgf5LO1jOwNAYYDl-MVwQcU4vCjZDx-UK8pNpD7wgzoJLPmELPr3294uQwueD1tv3L3mvVmZPS-4iPRQ22geeZ4HemOYtNqHjjmPIx6eTXWrdbpapR_k28WDdLo1AgTebPLUpfJg15nyuXb5AJjmvbCko4Pviio3Sh6o1hdmbN1K_mqkOgYW8uTY4407G9fUSUgHIpA-W0lsIXlOY4xX0D7vXK-s1X8a_udOowOyA27AjhZkV73piWa_ySwekwsC1va2QBrWr1Y6Va5Lf0o6rFK3gcmSmfBt9_in3wX_gIk2RMEYJxVQExiV9dWvHMCH5YzWxIvKXKgiNQSiUgvqRskV